---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base meta={{ title: 'About — Lilitha Mdlalana' }}>
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="page-header fade-in">
        <span class="section-label">About</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">A little about me</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="about-body">
        <div class="about-text fade-in">
          <p>
            Hey, I'm Lilitha — a curious mind, a self-taught coder but also
            <span class="wtc-tip" title="WeThinkCode_">WTC-made</span>, and a
            creative at heart.
          </p>

          <p>
            I started software development back in high school in 2019. It
            began as a hobby, sparked by my love for sci-fi movies and an
            obsession with the cool tech they featured. I remember being
            fascinated by how software seemed to power everything — from video
            games and social media, to the apps we use every day.
          </p>

          <p>
            While the world suggested a more traditional path (doctor,
            lawyer... you know how it goes), I chose code — and I haven't
            looked back.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider fade-in"></div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
          <h2>What I'm doing now</h2>
          <p>
            I'm currently a <strong>Software Engineer at Mukuru</strong>, where
            I build and maintain frontend products with React, TypeScript, and
            Chakra UI. Every day is a step forward — shipping features,
            reviewing code, and learning from brilliant engineers.
          </p>
          <p>
            Beyond the 9-to-5, I'm constantly building side projects, writing
            about what I'm learning, and refining my skills across frontend and
            backend.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider fade-in"></div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
          <h2>Outside of code</h2>
          <ul class="interest-list">
            <li>🎸 Playing guitar — fingerstyle and R&amp;B-inspired progressions</li>
            <li>🎮 Gaming — always down for a good challenge</li>
            <li>🎥 Watching sci-fi (still can't get enough)</li>
            <li>⚽ Playing or watching football</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="divider fade-in"></div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
          <h2>Skills</h2>
          <div class="skills-grid">
            <span class="tag accent">JavaScript</span>
            <span class="tag blue">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tag accent">React</span>
            <span class="tag">Next.js</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Chakra UI</span>
            <span class="tag">Flutter &amp; Dart</span>
            <span class="tag">Java</span>
            <span class="tag">Python</span>
            <span class="tag">SQL</span>
            <span class="tag">Firebase</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Docker</span>
            <span class="tag">Astro</span>
            <span class="tag green">Markdown/MDX</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider fade-in"></div>

        <div class="about-section fade-in">
          <h2>What drives me</h2>
          <p>
            I believe in building things that are both useful and meaningful —
            tools, stories, or ideas that make people feel something. My dream
            is to keep growing as a developer and maybe help others along the
            way. Creativity, curiosity, and coffee — that's my stack.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-block fade-in">
          <p class="contact-eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
          <div class="contact-links">
            <a href="mailto:innomdlalana@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">✉ Email Me</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/lilitha-mdlalana" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">↗ GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/lilitha-mdlalana" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">↗ LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-wrap {
    padding: 120px 0 100px;
  }

  .page-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--accent);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-body {
    max-width: 700px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .about-text p,
  .about-section p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text2);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-section {
    padding: 40px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-section strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .divider {
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .interest-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text2);
    line-height: 1.65;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .wtc-tip {
    border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--accent);
    cursor: help;
  }

  .contact-block {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 40px;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .contact-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-wrap { padding: 100px 0 80px; }
    .contact-block { padding: 24px; }
  }
</style>
